    {
      "id": "m-731ca54c",
      "conversationId": "c-9ea9e15a",
      "agent": "roundtable",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "用一句话回答：多 Agent 中台里，最该优先解决的可靠性问题是什么？",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-07T13:57:42.736Z",
      "meta": {
        "relayOf": null,
        "inReplyTo": null,
        "elapsedMs": null,
        "usage": null,
        "kind": null,
        "contextReset": false,
        "attempts": null,
        "warnings": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-a77c7a7a",
      "conversationId": "c-9ea9e15a",
      "agent": "minimax",
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "建立可观测、可重试、可降级的统一任务执行与状态持久化机制，确保 Agent 任务在异常情况下可恢复、不丢失、不重复。",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-07T13:57:45.193Z",
      "meta": {
        "relayOf": null,
        "inReplyTo": null,
        "elapsedMs": 2456,
        "usage": {
          "input_tokens": 149,
          "output_tokens": 32,
          "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0,
          "cache_read_input_tokens": 128,
          "service_tier": "standard"
        },
        "kind": null,
        "contextReset": false,
        "attempts": null,
        "warnings": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-fab4f0af",
      "conversationId": "c-9ea9e15a",
      "agent": "dsh",
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "优先解决**跨 Agent 交接时的状态一致性**——即用持久化、可重放的状态机加幂等键保证任务不丢、不重、可恢复，因为多 Agent 中台绝大多数线上事故都发生在\"某个 Agent 以为另一步做完了、实际没有\"的交接缝隙里。",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-07T13:57:46.128Z",
      "meta": {
        "relayOf": null,
        "inReplyTo": null,
        "elapsedMs": 3391,
        "usage": {
          "inputTokens": 141,
          "outputTokens": 190,
          "cacheReadTokens": 8448,
          "cacheWriteTokens": 0,
          "totalTokens": 8779
        },
        "kind": null,
        "contextReset": false,
        "attempts": null,
        "warnings": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-f09229d6",
      "conversationId": "c-9ea9e15a",
      "agent": "kimi",
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "多 Agent 中台最该优先解决的是**编排与故障隔离**：确保单个 Agent 的超时、错误或幻觉不会级联扩散，同时做到可重试、可回滚、全链路可观测。",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-07T13:57:48.629Z",
      "meta": {
        "relayOf": null,
        "inReplyTo": null,
        "elapsedMs": 5892,
        "usage": null,
        "kind": null,
        "contextReset": false,
        "attempts": null,
        "warnings": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-e62e060e",
      "conversationId": "c-9ea9e15a",
      "agent": "codex",
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "最该优先解决的是：让每个 Agent 的任务状态与执行结果都有可验证的证据，确保失败能被发现、重试不会重复执行，并能随时交给人接管。",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-07T13:57:57.254Z",
      "meta": {
        "relayOf": null,
        "inReplyTo": null,
        "elapsedMs": 14517,
        "usage": {
          "input_tokens": 24292,
          "cached_input_tokens": 13184,
          "cache_write_input_tokens": 0,
          "output_tokens": 49,
          "reasoning_output_tokens": 0
